# FIJI Website — optional local overrides.
# Next.js sets NODE_ENV automatically. No secrets are required for the static marketing site today.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` if you later add analytics, CMS, or form backends:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# GitHub Pages parity (optional — CI sets this from the repo name automatically):
#   STATIC_EXPORT_REPO=FIJI   # omit leading slash; must match github.io/<THIS>/
